window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Ivar The Destroyer is dead. Killed by my hands.</p> <p>Now, I hold the throne, and the Berserkers look to me for leadership. But loyalty runs deep-can I really trust the men who followed Ivar's ruthless orders? So much blood has been spilled to end this fight before it ever began, but bigger challenges loom.</p> <p>My men were captured and taken to The Cities, and now fractured pasts, lies, and love will blur together as I fight to save the only people I care about-the men I love. It's a race against time, and an exercise in trust requiring the assistance of both family and allies, new and old, from all four corners of the Wastes.</p> <p>Slave. Champion. Queen. I am all of these and so much more. It's time I showed them who I really am.</p> <p>The Wasteland is changing, I can feel it in the air, war . . . war is coming and I will lead the battle cry.</p> <p>Long live the Berserker Queen.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
